      "sourceTextSha256": "445ce45c38828437faba362259449cd074dc74df00d23911d051fd43fc989aa6",
      "text": "Spend 12 days exploring two Central American countries. In Costa Rica, visit the Arenal Volcano area, the Caño Negro Wildlife Refuge and Río Celeste, as well as coffee and cacao plantations, hanging bridges and waterfalls. Then fly by private plane to Nicaragua, where you’ll see colonial Granada, Masaya Volcano and Lake Nicaragua. Spend the final days by the freshwater Apoyo Lagoon.",
